msgid "The full CI program"
msgstr "全组态相互作用程序"

msgid "This module is the determinant full CI program, as described in"
msgstr "本模块为行列式全组态相互作用程序，如以下文献所述："

msgid ""
"Published work resulting from the use of this program should cite these "
"references."
msgstr "使用本程序发表的成果应引用这些参考文献。"

msgid ""
"The program in normal use finds the lowest eigenvector of the complete CI "
"hamiltonian matrix; more sophisticated use is possible, but not documented "
"here. The program is interfaced to free standing versions such as supplied "
"in the CPC program library by use of the ``DUMP`` option."
msgstr ""
"该程序在正常使用中寻找完整CI哈密顿矩阵的最低本征向量；更高级的用法是可能的，但此处未作说明。该程序通过使用 ``DUMP`` "
"选项与独立版本（例如CPC程序库中提供的版本）进行接口。"

msgid "The program is called with the command ``FCI``."
msgstr "该程序通过命令 ``FCI`` 调用。"

msgid "Defining the orbitals"
msgstr "定义轨道"

msgid ""
"*name.file* specifies the record from which orbitals are read. The default "
"is the set of orbitals from the last SCF, MCSCF or CI calculation."
msgstr "*name.file* 指定从中读取轨道的记录。默认是从上一次 SCF、MCSCF 或 CI 计算得到的轨道集。"

msgid "Occupied orbitals"
msgstr "占据轨道"

msgid ""
":math:`n_i` specifies numbers of occupied orbitals (including ``CORE``) in "
"irreducible representation number :math:`i`. If not given, the default is "
"the complete basis set."
msgstr ""
":math:`n_i` 指定不可约表示编号 :math:`i` 中的占据轨道数（包括 ``CORE``\\ ）。如果未指定，默认使用完整的基组。"

msgid "Frozen-core orbitals"
msgstr "冻结芯轨道"

msgid "``CORE``"
msgstr "``CORE``"

msgid "Defining the state symmetry"
msgstr "定义态对称性"

msgid ""
"The number of electrons and the total symmetry of the wavefunction are "
"specified on the ``WF`` card:"
msgstr "电子数和波函数的总对称性在 ``WF`` 卡片上指定："

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid "Density matrix"
msgstr "密度矩阵"

msgid "The 1-electron density matrix can be computed with"
msgstr "单电子密度矩阵可通过以下方式计算"

msgid ""
"and then subsequently used to calculate one-electron properties using the "
"``PROP`` program."
msgstr "随后可使用 ``PROP`` 程序计算单电子性质。"

msgid "Excited states"
msgstr "激发态"

msgid "Specifies the number of states to be sought (default 1)."
msgstr "指定要寻找的态的数量（默认为1）。"

msgid "Convergence threshold"
msgstr "收敛阈值"

msgid ""
"Convergence threshold (default :math:`10^{-5}`). If changes in the "
"normalised wavefunction become less than this value, then the iterative "
"eigenvector solver terminates."
msgstr "收敛阈值（默认值 :math:`10^{-5}`\\ ）。如果归一化波函数的变化小于此值，则迭代特征向量求解器终止。"

msgid "Printing options"
msgstr "打印选项"

msgid ""
"Print options. Generally, the value determines how much intermediate "
"information is printed. *value*\\ =-1 means no print (default for all "
"codes). if *value* is omitted, it is taken as zero, which is usually "
"appropriate. Specification of higher values will generate more output. The "
"following codes are allowed:"
msgstr ""
"打印选项。通常，该值决定打印多少中间信息。\\ *值*\\ =-1 表示不打印（所有代码的默认值）。如果省略 *值*\\ "
"，则取为零，这通常是合适的。指定更高的值将生成更多输出。允许使用以下代码："

msgid "``ORBITAL`` Print molecular orbitals"
msgstr "``ORBITAL`` 打印分子轨道"

msgid "``INTEGRAL`` Print integrals"
msgstr "``INTEGRAL`` 打印积分"

msgid "``TIMING`` Print extra timing information"
msgstr "``TIMING`` 打印额外计时信息"

msgid "``DIAGONAL`` Print diagonal elements of Hamiltonian"
msgstr "``DIAGONAL`` 打印哈密顿量的对角元"

msgid "``HAMILTONIAN`` Print much intermediate information"
msgstr "``HAMILTONIAN`` 打印大量中间信息"

msgid "Interface to other programs"
msgstr "与其他程序的接口"

msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"
